  era: "Section 10 \xB7 Gupta Empire \xB7 c. 319 \u2013 550 CE"
  title: Gupta literature
  text: Sanskrit literature flourished. Kalidasa wrote Abhijnanashakuntalam, Meghaduta and Raghuvamsha; Vishakhadatta wrote Mudrarakshasa; and Shudraka, Mrichchhakatika. The Panchatantra and the later forms of the Puranas belong to this broad period.
